{"author":[{"collection_id":"Authors","document_content":{"avatar":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_50ac3cbb26fa4c21a9967e26675f94c5_/e542d55e05d06e63bbf3dadd467d6f4889a15a6c2c43b46c812a48b6ee2adf7ff126e17cb0d3c04d4d2f24d216f00138ed4cd9cbf209538cb1bd0f4fd7ac7f15","height":2000,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/ECgal03qq-GPHfoWRZft82d97qPwwB-M4z1d-igDCWWAMWhJteOVP4HzaU2XhhQVfG9ME-_0DWTFA1eK28kgnTgTHBpSnTIhLK8TQKwE0zyq_lFckrs","width":2000},"name":"James Williams","title":"Material Developer Advocate"},"document_id":5856972825690112,"document_label":null,"repo_id":"mio-example"}],"body_content":[{"code_snippet":["```java\n<com.google.android.material.carousel.MaskableFrameLayout\n  xmlns:android=\"http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android\"\n  xmlns:app=\"http://schemas.android.com/apk/res-auto\"\n  xmlns:tools=\"http://schemas.android.com/tools\"\n  android:id=\"@+id/carousel_item_container\"\n  android:layout_width=\"130dp\"\n  android:layout_height=\"match_parent\"\n  android:layout_marginStart=\"4dp\"\n  android:layout_marginEnd=\"4dp\"\n  android:foreground=\"?attr/selectableItemBackground\"\n  app:shapeAppearance=\"?attr/shapeAppearanceCornerExtraLarge\">\n  <ImageView\n    android:id=\"@+id/carousel_image_view\"\n    android:layout_width=\"match_parent\"\n    android:layout_height=\"match_parent\"\n    android:scaleType=\"centerCrop\"\n    tools:ignore=\"ContentDescription\" />\n</com.google.android.material.carousel.MaskableFrameLayout>"],"content":"<p>紧随 Google I/O 之后，我们高兴地宣布 Material Design Components for Android（MDC-Android）1.9.0 正式发布。</p>\n<p>全新的轮播（Carousel）组件让你可以创建照片画廊之类的体验，并以比 <code>RecyclerView</code> 更灵活的方式与条目列表交互。</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-video index=\"0\"&gt;&lt;/mio-video&gt;</p>\n<p>它以 <code>RecyclerView</code> 为核心，因此你可以放心，它会有良好的性能表现，并能轻松集成到你的设计中。</p>\n<h2>将你的 RecyclerView 变成轮播</h2>\n<p>要使用 <code>Carousel</code>，请从一个可正常运行的 <code>RecyclerView</code> 开始，并用 <code>MaskableFrameLayout</code> 包裹每一个条目布局文件。它们会告诉 Carousel 应如何调整条目彼此之间的关系。</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-code-snippet index=0&gt;&lt;/mio-code-snippet&gt;</p>\n<p>接下来，不要使用 <code>LinearLayoutManager</code>，而是使用 <code>CarouselLayoutManager</code>。</p>\n<p><code>MaskableFrameLayout</code> 的遮罩范围从 0% 到 100%（代码中为 0.0 到 1.0）。当布局管理器需要遮罩一张图片时，它会计算出一个遮罩矩形。下图展示了对同一张图片应用不同遮罩的效果，以及每种遮罩会如何减少图片的可见区域。</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-image index=0&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</p>\n<p>如果你在轮播中使用的图片带有自定义的 image matrix，或包含文本等其他组件，请验证这些对象能否与 Carousel 的遮罩配合良好，也可以选择在 <code>MaskableFrameLayout</code> 上设置 <code>OnMaskChangedListener</code>，让它们响应遮罩尺寸的变化。</p>\n<h2>轮播中的条目如何被遮罩</h2>\n<p><code>MultiBrowseCarouselStrategy</code> 让轮播能够在给定空间内以最优方式展示大、中、小条目。它会尝试找出能在尺寸调整最少的情况下放入显示区域的大条目最佳数量，然后再添加中、小条目。</p>\n<p>在下图中，轮播的开头可以看到两个大条目、一个中条目和一个小条目。而在轮播末尾，排列变为一个小条目，接着是一个中条目，最后是两个大条目。</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 99.4334%;\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 45.9929%;\">&lt;mio-image index=1&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</td>\n<td style=\"width: 45.9929%;\">&lt;mio-image index=2&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>有关将新轮播组件集成到你应用中的更多信息，请查阅完整的<a href=\"https://github.com/material-components/material-components-android/blob/master/docs/components/Carousel.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">开发者文档</a>。</p>\n<h2>MDC 的下一步是什么？</h2>\n<p>我们正在努力开发 1.10.0 版本，其中包含面向 Android U 的更新。这些文章中重点介绍的组件或功能只是每个版本所交付工作中的一小部分。完整清单请查看<a href=\"https://github.com/material-components/material-components-android/releases/tag/1.9.0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">发布说明</a>。</p>\n<p>你可以在 GitHub 上关注新版本的进展、提交<a href=\"https://github.com/material-components/material-components-android/issues/new?assignees=&amp;labels=bug&amp;template=bug_report.md&amp;title=%5BComponent+name%5D+Short+description+of+issue\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">bug 报告</a>和<a href=\"https://github.com/material-components/material-components-android/issues/new?assignees=&amp;labels=feature+request&amp;template=feature_request.md&amp;title=%5BComponent+name%5D+Short+description+of+request\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">功能请求</a>。查看<a href=\"https://github.com/material-components/material-components-android/releases/download/1.9.0/catalog-debug.apk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">catalog 应用</a>，了解组件的实际效果。也欢迎随时在 Twitter 上联系我们 <a href=\"https://twitter.com/materialdesign\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">@materialdesign</a>。</p>","image":[{"a11y_description":"diagram of how images are masked in a carousel","bordered":true,"caption":null,"case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/f70b6f1de6c969344f6c760ad4600ea83732f3855a181f2d9279ff713038f2bfc2dd240754c17e311e8f2009c41c111ff73ffd59cfaeb591a71e239d4d8a7840","height":478,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/6IdEWOsFfVrq_d0Yr-NSgnP0iMH-2jsQxlt0pB3hbWTUvVsevd3TdlUWS32V8ZloH9ymGp4zOjQR5XciIDrSvdpVwhY2kz9WQhc7Vok0xAUIsKTqhFk","width":1178}},{"a11y_description":"screenshot of carousel in catalog app with scroll position at 0","bordered":false,"caption":null,"case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/8a6545d4199765d94839745480deae916b4109e6158820cabbbb3672cce0b8a612e6f0b0370c361785c388b4bb6b1650f7a381b9e0fff8c09ae2165c0e605a4f","height":2400,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/Q5PAFl0kJtvPGHel0TWAXN21Ym5Bal6SlaAkk33imuaKmDaQarDmkn6EgtPE31w0mMYFouo7R92edY5Iae_W81NHqWyv0rXF3mqFuNHVMrzICiLVTQk","width":1080}},{"a11y_description":"screenshot of carousel in catalog app with scroll position at 100","bordered":false,"caption":null,"case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/b34a5b397e12f4b8220d12b91d4cc356ca553d4575def5d4a598da41970f337bfbca440130a417cdbea907191f515a63bbfd77c014be3768617bb635f5af7fb1","height":2400,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/6vKpHerJbKyf8Xm_3u8Kzkg_LpA-AEjxDuzzkK5hhfqbIkqA_oqJlAZ5E1p14Sus8Y7mRRhb4f1MVM7GzlGj4VtV18PeSRd4bcSSWNL1frlFC1jGSfM","width":1080}}],"related_links":[],"table":[],"video":[{"a11y_d